f The\ufeff decision \ufeffis \ufeffmade \ufeffconsidering\ufeff the \ufeffdomain \ufeffor \ufeffsubject \ufeffof \ufeffthe \ufeffpost\ufeff and\ufeff retrieving\ufeff data \ufeffassociated\ufeff with \ufeffit \ufefffrom\ufeff the\ufeff web\ufeff at \ufeffregular \ufefftime\ufeff intervals.\ufeff The\ufeff retrieved\ufeff data \ufeffhas \ufeffbeen \ufefftrained \ufeffusing \ufefflogistics \ufeffand\ufeff K-NN\ufeff regression \ufeffto \ufeffclassify \ufeffa\ufeff particular \ufeffinstance \ufeffof \ufeffdata \ufeffand \ufeffidentify\ufeff the \ufeffplatform\ufeff which \ufeffcan \ufeffprovide\ufeff the \ufeffmost \ufeffreachability.\ufeff The\ufeff system\ufeff also \ufeffsuggests \ufeffkeywords \ufeffrelated \ufeffto \ufeffthe \ufefftopic \ufeffof \ufeffthe\ufeff post\ufeff which\ufeff has\ufeff been \ufeffmostly \ufeffused \ufeffin \ufeffrecent \ufefftimes.","topics":[],"score":217211,"global_rank":219241},{"name":"abhiz123/bandit","owner":"abhiz123","html_url":"https://github.com/abhiz123/bandit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A simulation on the K-armed bandit problem","topics":[],"score":217211,"global_rank":219253},{"name":"LeoKuhorev/django_intro","owner":"LeoKuhorev","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoKuhorev/django_intro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217211,"global_rank":219255},{"name":"djfigs1/Scouts-Pancake-Factory","owner":"djfigs1","html_url":"https://github.com/djfigs1/Scouts-Pancake-Factory","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"I will finish this soon I promise","topics":[],"score":217211,"global_rank":219262},{"name":"ajh1143/GraduateAdmissionsDataScienceAnalysis","owner":"ajh1143","html_url":"https://github.com/ajh1143/GraduateAdmissionsDataScienceAnalysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Kaggle Dataset Analysis - Graduate Admissions","topics